{{TrekkerSkill
| name = Storm Flash: Radiance
| brief = Rapidly swings the longsword to deal DMG multiple times, then slams down with the greatsword to deal AoE DMG and generate Starfall. The Main Skill can trigger {{word|Lux Mark|light}}.<br>Upgrade materials: {{Item|Radiant Feather Crown}} {{Item|Chess Piece of Skill}} {{Item|Kung Fu Game Cartridge}} {{Item|Fighting Game Cartridge}} {{Item|Phantom Game Cartridge}}
| cooldown = 10.0
| desc_1 = Rapidly swings the longsword [Dawn], dealing {{color|#fb8037|36% x5}} of Max HP as AoE Lux Skill DMG. Then slams down with the greatsword [Daybreak], dealing {{color|#fb8037|64%}} of Max HP as AoE Lux Auto Attack DMG, and generates 1 Starfall that deals {{color|#fb8037|23%}} of Max HP as AoE Lux Auto Attack DMG. Storm Flash: Radiance (Main Skill) can trigger {{word|Lux Mark|light}} to generate {{word|Lucent|}}: deals {{SkillLevelHint|breakthrough|21%/27%/33%/39%/45%/51%/58%/64%/70%}} of Max HP as AoE Lux Mark DMG and inflicts 1 stack of {{word|Glimmer|}}.<br>Upgrade materials: {{Item|Kung Fu Game Cartridge|quantity=6}} {{Item|Chess Piece of Skill|quantity=2}} {{Item|Dorra|quantity=13300}}
