{{TrekkerSkill
| name = Empyrean Starender
| brief = Firstlight Noya's Ultimate has two forms, attacking with the greatsword [Daybreak] and the longsword [Dawn] respectively to deal large AoE DMG. When casting the Ultimate, Firstlight Noya gains Starender: increases Crit Rate. The Ultimate can trigger {{word|Lux Mark|light}}.<br>Upgrade materials: {{Item|Radiant Feather Crown}} {{Item|Chess Piece of Skill}} {{Item|Kung Fu Game Cartridge}} {{Item|Fighting Game Cartridge}} {{Item|Phantom Game Cartridge}}
| cooldown = 30.0
| energy = 235.0
| desc_1 = Firstlight Noya's Ultimate has two forms, attacking with the greatsword [Daybreak] and the longsword [Dawn] respectively. She enters battle with the greatsword-form Ultimate by default. Greatsword Form: Leaps into the air and swings the greatsword, dealing {{color|#fb8037|216% x5}} and {{color|#fb8037|270%}} of Max HP as AoE Lux Auto Attack DMG in a large area. Longsword Form: Dashes quickly and attacks at high speed, dealing {{color|#fb8037|54% x7}} of Max HP as AoE Lux Skill DMG in a large area, then generates a field that deals {{color|#fb8037|109% x7}} of Max HP as AoE Lux Skill DMG in a large area. When casting Empyrean Starender (Ultimate), Firstlight Noya gains Starender: increases Crit Rate by {{color|#fb8037|7.1%}} for 30s. Empyrean Starender (Ultimate) can trigger {{word|Lux Mark|light}} to generate {{word|Lucent|}}: deals {{SkillLevelHint|breakthrough|21%/27%/33%/39%/45%/51%/58%/64%/70%}} of Max HP as AoE Lux Mark DMG and inflicts 1 stack of {{word|Glimmer|}}.<br>Upgrade materials: {{Item|Kung Fu Game Cartridge|quantity=6}} {{Item|Chess Piece of Skill|quantity=2}} {{Item|Dorra|quantity=13300}}
