| name = Fisher's Hunt
| brief = Fires cuttlefish shells to deal DMG in a large area.<br/>Karin can consume Hunting Energy to fire a chain that links with a target, increasing Karin's Auto Attack DMG while the chain is active.<br>Upgrade materials: {{Item|Crimson Tempter}} {{Item|Chess Piece of Skill}} {{Item|Shooter Game Cartridge}} {{Item|Barrage Game Cartridge}} {{Item|Demon Bee Game Cartridge}}
| desc_1 = Fires cuttlefish shells, each dealing {{color|#ec6d21|49%}} of ATK as AoE Umbra Auto Attack DMG.<br/>Karin has {{word|Hunting Energy|}} and can automatically consume 100 {{word|Hunting Energy|}} to throw a chain, inflicting {{word|Hunter's Mark|}} on the target and forming a link. While the chain is active, increases Karin's Auto Attack DMG by {{color|#ec6d21|5.8%}}.<br>Upgrade materials: {{Item|Shooter Game Cartridge|quantity=6}} {{Item|Chess Piece of Skill|quantity=2}} {{Item|Dorra|quantity=13300}}
| desc_2 = Fires cuttlefish shells, each dealing {{color|#ec6d21|56%}} of ATK as AoE Umbra Auto Attack DMG.<br/>Karin has {{word|Hunting Energy|}} and can automatically consume 100 {{word|Hunting Energy|}} to throw a chain, inflicting {{word|Hunter's Mark|}} on the target and forming a link. While the chain is active, increases Karin's Auto Attack DMG by {{color|#ec6d21|6.7%}}.<br>Upgrade materials: {{Item|Shooter Game Cartridge|quantity=12}} {{Item|Chess Piece of Skill|quantity=6}} {{Item|Dorra|quantity=17600}}
