{{TrekkerSkill
| name = Raging Sea
| brief = Swings the harpoon chain repeatedly to deal multiple instances of DMG while summoning Boss Shark multiple times to pursue and devour targets.<br>Upgrade materials: {{Item|Crimson Tempter}} {{Item|Chess Piece of Skill}} {{Item|Shooter Game Cartridge}} {{Item|Barrage Game Cartridge}} {{Item|Demon Bee Game Cartridge}}
| cooldown = 12.0
