{{TrekkerSkill
| name = Luminous Leaper
| brief = When tapping the Main Skill button, different effects occur based on the current {{word|Decibels|}}. {{color|#0abec5|Current Decibels below 100:}} Switches back and forth between Bubble Machine and Megaphone modes. {{color|#0abec5|Current Decibels at 100:}} Consumes all Decibels at once and launches a Bubble Frog: every bounce creates an impact dealing AoE Aqua Skill DMG and inflicting {{word|Aqua Mark: Torrent|water}}. When Bubble Frog deals DMG, increases the squad's ATK.<br>Upgrade materials: {{Item|Nightlit Haven}} {{Item|Chess Piece of Skill}} {{Item|Tapping Game Cartridge}} {{Item|Rhythm Game Cartridge}} {{Item|Magic Sound Game Cartridge}}
| cooldown = 1.0
