| brief = Tap: Chaton fires a laser at the target, inflicting Lock Mark and dealing DMG over time. Hold: Chaton throws Bouncing Bombs at the target, dealing AoE DMG. The Main Skill can trigger {{word|Ignis Mark|fire}} and generate Conflagration.<br>Upgrade materials: {{Item|Colossus Core}} {{Item|Chess Piece of Skill}} {{Item|Shooter Game Cartridge}} {{Item|Barrage Game Cartridge}} {{Item|Demon Bee Game Cartridge}}
| cooldown = 6.0
| desc_1 = Chaton uses different attack methods depending on whether the skill button is tapped or held. {{color|#0abec5|Tap:}} activates {{word|Dark Ray|}}. Chaton fires a laser at the target, dealing {{color|#fb8037|224%}} of ATK as Ignis Skill DMG and inflicting Dark Mark for 14s. Chaton deals {{color|#fb8037|64%}} of ATK as Ignis Skill DMG to targets inflicted with Dark Mark every 2s. {{color|#0abec5|Hold:}} activates {{word|Bouncing Kitty Bomb|}}. Chaton throws 2 Bouncing Bombs at the target, each dealing {{color|#fb8037|62%}} of ATK as AoE Ignis Skill DMG. Bouncing Bombs then bounce to nearby targets, up to 5 times. Sniper Operation (Main Skill) can trigger {{word|Ignis Mark|fire}} and generate Conflagration: deals {{SkillLevelHint|breakthrough|28.7%/37.2%/45.8%/54.4%/63%/71.5%/80.1%/88.7%/97.2%}} of ATK as Ignis Mark DMG.<br>Upgrade materials: {{Item|Shooter Game Cartridge|quantity=6}} {{Item|Chess Piece of Skill|quantity=2}} {{Item|Dorra|quantity=13300}}
