{{TrekkerSkill
| name = Dark Evil Eye
| brief = Unseals Evil Eye to deal AoE DMG, triggering {{word|Ignis Mark|fire}} and generating Conflagration. After casting the Ultimate, Chaton enters the {{word|Evil Eye Unleashed|}} state, gaining enhanced Auto Attacks, Super Armor, and increased Ultimate DMG and Movement SPD.<br>Upgrade materials: {{Item|Colossus Core}} {{Item|Chess Piece of Skill}} {{Item|Shooter Game Cartridge}} {{Item|Barrage Game Cartridge}} {{Item|Demon Bee Game Cartridge}}
| cooldown = 30.0
| energy = 228.0
| desc_1 = Unseals Evil Eye to inflict Cat Eye Mark on all nearby targets for 15s, then sweep fires, dealing {{color|#fb8037|153% x8}} of ATK as AoE Ignis Ultimate DMG and detonating Cat Eye Marks to deal {{color|#fb8037|180%}} of ATK as Ignis Ultimate DMG. Dark Evil Eye (Ultimate) can trigger {{word|Ignis Mark|fire}}, generating Conflagration: deals {{SkillLevelHint|breakthrough|28.7%/37.2%/45.8%/54.4%/63%/71.5%/80.1%/88.7%/97.2%}} of ATK as Ignis Mark DMG. After casting the Ultimate, Chaton enters the {{word|Evil Eye Unleashed|}} state for 15s while gaining Super Armor, enhancing her Auto Attacks to Dark Burst, increasing her Ultimate DMG by 20% and her Movement SPD by 30%.<br>Upgrade materials: {{Item|Shooter Game Cartridge|quantity=6}} {{Item|Chess Piece of Skill|quantity=2}} {{Item|Dorra|quantity=13300}}
