'''Sparkla''' is a 5-star Terra Trekker. She is a genius inventor and a fugitive wanted by the [[Grace Imperium]] for Neo equipment trafficking.

== Profile ==
''"Sparkla's Super Action Pie and Rabbit Pie builds can shift into different modes to counter enemies depending on battlefield conditions."''

