| brief = Tap to enter {{word|Bunny Jaws Mode|}}, firing slow, heavy shots to deal AoE DMG.  Hold to enter {{word|Bunny Rapid Fire Mode|}}, firing rapid shots that deal multiple instances of damage. Both modes can trigger {{word|Terra Mark|earth}}.<br>Upgrade materials: {{Item|Forest Elf Fang}} {{Item|Chess Piece of Skill}} {{Item|Kung Fu Game Cartridge}} {{Item|Fighting Game Cartridge}} {{Item|Phantom Game Cartridge}}
