  | desc = When All-Out Bunny Barrage (Ultimate) ends, drops 3 bottles of Potent Neo Solution on the ground. The Main Trekker can absorb them on contact, with each bottle increasing their ATK by {{color|#ec6d21|7%/11%/16%/20%/24%/29%}} for 10s. When a Terra Trekker absorbs 3 bottles of Potent Neo Solution and deals Auto Attack DMG, Sparkla deals an additional {{color|#ec6d21|86%/137%/189%/240%/292%/343%}} of her ATK as Terra Ultimate DMG. This effect can only be triggered once every 0.5s.
