'''Firefly''' is a Trekker in Stella Sora.

== Profile ==
''"Firefly, who controls transformable armament, is said to be a super weapon secretly developed by Grace Imperium. The firefly-like glow, when gathered in multitude, can become a cannon capable of extreme destruction."''

