{{TrekkerSkill
| name = Starflare Pursuit
| brief = Firefly enters {{word|Sword Form|}}, transforming {{word|Avalanche|}} into Avalanche: Giant Sword and Avalanche: Flying Blades to attack the target for a period of time. Avalanche: Giant Sword and Avalanche: Flying Blades can inflict {{word|Lux Mark: Radiance|light}}.<br>Upgrade materials: {{Item|Radiant Crown Essence}} {{Item|Chess Piece of Skill}} {{Item|Tapping Game Cartridge}} {{Item|Rhythm Game Cartridge}} {{Item|Magic Sound Game Cartridge}}
| cooldown = 24.0
| desc_1 = Firefly enters {{word|Sword Form|}} for 16s , during which, transforms 2 {{word|Avalanche|}} into Avalanche: Giant Sword and 2 {{word|Avalanche|}} into Avalanche: Flying Blades. Firefly wields Avalanche: Giant Sword to attack the target. Strike 1: {{color|#fb8037|90%}} of ATK as Lux Auto ATK DMG. Strike 2: {{color|#fb8037|90%}} of ATK as Lux Auto ATK DMG. Strike 3: {{color|#fb8037|90%}} of ATK as Lux Auto ATK DMG. Strike 4: {{color|#fb8037|66% x5}} of ATK as Lux Auto ATK DMG. While {{word|Sword Form|}} is active, automatically fires all Avalanche: Flying Blades every 3s to attack the target, dealing {{color|#fb8037|48%}} of ATK as Lux Skill DMG to targets along their path. Avalanche: Giant Sword and Avalanche: Flying Blades inflict {{word|Lux Mark: Radiance|light}} when dealing DMG.<br>Upgrade materials: {{Item|Tapping Game Cartridge|quantity=6}} {{Item|Chess Piece of Skill|quantity=2}} {{Item|Dorra|quantity=13300}}
