{{TrekkerSkill
| name = Whip Assault
| brief = Whips forward to attack the target, boosting the toys' Morale and triggering the Synergy Skill of the toys. The Main Skill can trigger {{word|Ignis Mark|fire}} and inflict Conflagration.<br>Upgrade materials: {{Item|Colossus Essence}} {{Item|Chess Piece of Skill}} {{Item|Tapping Game Cartridge}} {{Item|Rhythm Game Cartridge}} {{Item|Magic Sound Game Cartridge}}
| cooldown = 8.0
| desc_1 = Whips forward to attack the target, dealing {{color|#fb8037|85%}} of ATK as AoE Ignis Skill DMG and granting 1 stack of Morale to the toys. If the toys are within the Main Skill's Attack Range, they gain 1 additional stack of Morale. When casting the Main Skill, toys will cast the Synergy Skill to attack the target. {{word|Colonel Walnut|}} smashes the ground, dealing {{color|#fb8037|115%}} of ATK as AoE Ignis Minion DMG, and gains 1 stack of Morale. {{word|General Curly|}} swings dual blades, dealing {{color|#fb8037|241% x2}} of ATK as AoE Ignis Minion DMG. Whip Assault (Main Skill) can trigger {{word|Ignis Mark|fire}} and inflict Conflagration, dealing {{SkillLevelHint|breakthrough|40%/52%/64%/76%/88%/100%/112%/124%/136%}} of ATK as Ignis Mark DMG.<br>Upgrade materials: {{Item|Tapping Game Cartridge|quantity=6}} {{Item|Chess Piece of Skill|quantity=2}} {{Item|Dorra|quantity=13300}}
