{{TrekkerSkill
| name = Courtesy Before Aggression
| brief = Commands the turret to fire Gift Box Shells at the target, dealing DMG and inflicting {{word|Ignis Mark: Sacred Flame|fire}}. The Gift Box Shell summons {{word|Colonel Walnut|}} upon explosion to continuously attack the target.<br>Upgrade materials: {{Item|Colossus Essence}} {{Item|Chess Piece of Skill}} {{Item|Tapping Game Cartridge}} {{Item|Rhythm Game Cartridge}} {{Item|Magic Sound Game Cartridge}}
| cooldown = 18.0
