'''Nazuka''' is a Trekker and a former member of the [[Petal Bloom Guild]].

== Profile ==
'''Nazuka''' is a member of the [[Petal Bloom Guild]]. She specializes in using large-scale magic to control the battlefield, favoring "brains, not brawn."<ref>[[Nazuka/story#Weapon Anecdote: Timeless Grace|Weapon Anecdote: Timeless Grace]] from Nazuka's stories</ref><ref>[[Nazuka/story#CV Excerpt 3|CV Excerpt 3]] from Nazuka's stories</ref>

She is considered a role model and helped stabilize the local Trekker industry after the withdrawal of the Trekker Association.<ref>[[Nazuka/story#CV Excerpt 4|CV Excerpt 4]] from Nazuka's stories</ref><ref>[[Nazuka/story#CV Excerpt 1|CV Excerpt 1]] from Nazuka's stories</ref> She also authored the ''Trekker's Handbook'' and instructed rookies in Philae.<ref>[[Nazuka/story#CV Excerpt 5|CV Excerpt 5]] from Nazuka's stories</ref><ref>[[Nazuna/story#Instructor Nazuna|Instructor Nazuna]] from Nazuna's stories</ref>

Nazuka is known for an exhausting work ethic, often laboring from dawn until dusk.<ref>[[Nazuka/story#The Determination|The Determination]] from Nazuka's stories</ref><ref>[[Nazuka/story#CV Excerpt 4|CV Excerpt 4]] from Nazuka's stories</ref>

===Relationships===
Once close friends with [[Nazuna]], they drifted apart as Nazuka's success and busy schedule created distance between them.<ref>[[Nazuna/story#CV Excerpt 2|CV Excerpt 2]] from Nazuna's stories</ref><ref>Disc story of [[Unknown Fragrance#Story|Unknown Fragrance]]</ref> Nazuna describes her as a "perfect Trekker, terrible friend", while Nazuka praises Nazuna's hidden reliability.<ref>[[Nazuka/story#Peer Comments|Peer Comments]] from Nazuka's stories</ref><ref>[[Nazuna/story#Peer Comments|Peer Comments]] from Nazuna's stories</ref>

In [[Main Story/Chapter 3|chapter 3 of the main story]], Nazuka leaves Petal Bloom Guild, stating that other members are too weak and therefore is a burden to her.

