== Trivia ==

* Fuyuka's ultimate animation sparked controversy among Korean players because her hand position in several of her ultimate animation frames resembles the finger pinching or 🤏 gesture, which has ties to radical misandry groups in South Korea and is used to humiliate men with small penises ([https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Finger_pinching_conspiracy_theory Wikipedia]).
** In response, Yostar Korea issued a [https://x.com/StellaSoraKR/status/1989975324877295896 public statement] on their social media saying that they will change the ultimate animation, which they did as seen in this [https://x.com/StellaSoraKR/status/1990314352596189525 social media post].

