{{TrekkerSkill
| name = Whirling Waves
| brief = Summons several drones to attack the target repeatedly, dealing DMG. The Main Skill can trigger {{word|Lux Mark|light}} and summon a Thunderbolt.<br>Upgrade materials: {{Item|Radiant Feather Crown}} {{Item|Chess Piece of Skill}} {{Item|Shooter Game Cartridge}} {{Item|Barrage Game Cartridge}} {{Item|Demon Bee Game Cartridge}}
| cooldown = 14.0
