{{TrekkerSkill
| name = Syou: Pulsar Streak
| brief = Swings the baseball bat to attack the target, then activates Two Base Hit: Charges at the target for a rapid series of strikes. The Main Skill can trigger {{word|Lux Mark|light}} and summon a Thunderbolt.<br>Upgrade materials: {{Item|Radiant Crown Essence}} {{Item|Chess Piece of Skill}} {{Item|Kung Fu Game Cartridge}} {{Item|Fighting Game Cartridge}} {{Item|Phantom Game Cartridge}}
| cooldown = 14.0
