'''Gerie''' is a member of the [[Grace Imperium]].

== Profile ==
''"Gerie brandishes her chain-shovel "Mercy" with reckless abandon on the battlefield, crushing swathes of foes. She sows terror into her opponent's soul before delivering judgment."''

=== Background ===
Gerie is a high-ranking, composed, and devoted Chief Arbiter for the Grace Imperium, acting as a Vanguard/Inquisitive unit. Despite her calm, commanding demeanor, she displays extreme, obsessive dedication to doctrine, bordering on psychopathic instability, with tendencies to hear voices and hold a morbid fascination with death. A seeker, yet often roams the Wild and Monoliths. She seemingly driven by an intense unexplainable obsession with pain.

