{{TrekkerSkill
| name = Thorned Inferno
| brief = Leaps at the target, dealing AoE Terra DMG, and creates an Iron Cage that deals DMG over time. When Gerie is near the Iron Cage, she enters the Lethal status, which increases her Auto Attack DMG. The Main Skill can trigger {{word|Terra Mark|earth}}.<br>Upgrade materials: {{Item|Forest Elf Essence}} {{Item|Chess Piece of Skill}} {{Item|Kung Fu Game Cartridge}} {{Item|Fighting Game Cartridge}} {{Item|Phantom Game Cartridge}}
| cooldown = 14.0
| desc_1 = Leaps at the target, dealing {{color|#ec6d21|104%}} and {{color|#ec6d21|70%}} of ATK as AoE Terra Skill DMG, and creates an Iron Cage. Iron Cage: Links 2 nearby targets, dealing {{color|#ec6d21|31%}} of ATK as Terra Skill DMG every second for 8s. When Gerie is near the Iron Cage, she enters the Lethal status, which increases her Auto Attack DMG by {{color|#ec6d21|30%}}. Thorned Inferno (Main Skill) can trigger {{word|Terra Mark|earth}}, dealing {{SkillLevelHint|breakthrough|37%/48%/59%/70%/81%/92%/103%/114%/125%}} of ATK as AoE Terra Mark DMG.<br>Upgrade materials: {{Item|Kung Fu Game Cartridge|quantity=6}} {{Item|Chess Piece of Skill|quantity=2}} {{Item|Dorra|quantity=13300}}
