{{TrekkerSkill
| name = Bingo Crush
| brief = Raffles several times and follows the main Trekker, attacking in different ways based on the raffle results and gaining bonuses.<br>Upgrade materials: {{Item|Forest Elf Fang}} {{Item|Chess Piece of Skill}} {{Item|Shooter Game Cartridge}} {{Item|Barrage Game Cartridge}} {{Item|Demon Bee Game Cartridge}}
| cooldown = 20.0
| desc_1 = Raffles 5 times and follows the main Trekker. Full penguins: Throws the plushie and generates a penguin statue, dealing {{color|#fb8037|12% x7}} of ATK as AoE Terra Skill DMG. Full hearts: Shoots a heart arrow that restores the main Trekker's HP by {{color|#fb8037|5.9%}} and explodes, dealing {{color|#fb8037|41%}} of ATK as AoE Terra Skill DMG. Hearts and penguins: Shoots in a sweeping motion, dealing {{color|#fb8037|19% x6}} of ATK as Terra Skill DMG. All these attacks inflict {{word|Terra Mark: Earth Vein|earth}}. More penguins than hearts: The squad receives Kiss of Penguin, which increases ATK by {{color|#fb8037|22%}} for 3.5s. More hearts than penguins: The squad receives Kiss of Love, which increases Terra DMG by {{color|#fb8037|11%}} for 3.5s.<br>Upgrade materials: {{Item|Shooter Game Cartridge|quantity=6}} {{Item|Chess Piece of Skill|quantity=2}} {{Item|Dorra|quantity=13300}}
