'''Nanoha''' is a character who is a maid at the Goodwind Healthcare.

== Profile ==
''"Nanoha is a maid working at Goodwind who is also skilled in "Flower" Ninjutsu. She takes pride in her Sunflower Shuriken, which can hit its target while moving at high speed."''

=== Background ===
<tabber>
|-|English=
<p>A maid at the Goodwind Homecare.</p> <p>"Quick and efficient, leaves no trace." This might seem like an odd remark for a maid. But when she presents you with a handmade cupcake, her innocent look dispels all doubts.</p> <p>"Is there anything you wish to do together?"</p>
|-|Japanese=
<p>家事代行サービスを専門とするカンパニー</p> <p>『谷風家政』に所属する、奥ゆかしく物静かなメイド。</p> <p>仕事となれば、迅速かつ効率的にあらゆる家事を完璧にこなす。</p> <p>「お帰りなさいませ。お食事とお風呂、どちらになさいますか？」</p>
|-|Korean=
<p>여행가丨나노하</p> <p>가사 대행 업체 '타니카제 가사 대행' 소속 메이드.</p> <p>고상하고 차분한 성격이지만, 업무 중에는 신속하고 효율적으로 모든 가사를 수행한다.</p> <p>"메이드로서, 또 한 번 성장했네요."</p>
|-|Chinese=
<p>谷风家政的女仆。</p> <p>“动手迅速，现场干净。”对于一个女仆而言，这样的评价似乎有些奇怪。</p> <p>不过，当她端上自制的香甜小蛋糕时，一切疑虑都可以打消了。</p> <p>「请问……您需要“清扫”服务吗？」</p>
</tabber>

== Trivia ==

* She used to be called '''Hanahara''' in the early English localizations. Evidence can still be seen in the [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rs40AGfEv60 first gameplay trailer] for the game.
[[File:Nanoha_Old_EN_Name.png|145x145px|Nanoha's old EN name, '''Hanahara'''|alt=Nanoha's old EN name, Hanahara|thumb]]

