| desc_1 = Generates 2 stationary clones that attack enemies with shurikens, dealing of ATK<color=#ec6d21>19.4% x2, {{color|#ec6d21|19.4% x2}}, and <color=#ec6d21></color>28.4% x3</color> as Ventus Ultimate DMG. Each clone lasts for 25s. Up to 2 clones can be present simultaneously. When a clone deals DMG, it can trigger {{word|Ventus Mark|wind}} and create a Blossom, dealing {{SkillLevelHint|breakthrough|31%/40%/49%/58%/67%/77%/86%/95%/104%}} of ATK as AoE Ventus Mark DMG.<br>Upgrade materials: {{Item|Tapping Game Cartridge|quantity=6}} {{Item|Chess Piece of Skill|quantity=2}} {{Item|Dorra|quantity=13300}}
