'''Flora''' is a magician who is the founder of Ozora Production.

== Profile ==
''"Flora goes on tour in Nova to perform her original magic performance. Her fiery butterflies may seem fragile, but they are perfect fire starters that can burn her enemies into ashes."''

=== Background ===
An independent Trekker known for her magic shows across all of Nova. 

As the founder of "Ozora Production", Flora leads her dynamic crew on tours across the continent, enchanting audiences with laughter and wonder. Her flamboyant performances and visually stunning magic tricks never cease to captivate, leaving impressions that last long after the curtain falls. 

''"Don't blink, or you'll miss a true miracle!"''

