'''Ridge''' is a [[Trekkers|Trekker]] working for [[United Harvest]].

== Profile ==
''"Ridge is a United Harvest Forester with a habit of stockpiling food. She has a shovel that can fire energy blasts, and she fights alongside the seed plants she scatters on the field."''

