'''Coronis''' is a doctor in Emor City. She has a variant, [[Springseek Coronis]].

== Profile ==
''"A doctor obsessed with researching strange malady. She wields a scythe, dispenses deadly poisons, and moves through the battlefield with grace."''

=== Background ===
An unconventional doctor with an obsession for specimens.

Unlike the charlatans (her words) of Ash District who still cling to outdated practices like bloodletting, cauterization, and suspicious ointments, Coronis has invented groundbreaking medical theories. Inspired by her adventures as a Trekker and her discoveries within the Monoliths, these theories are considered controversial at best by traditional views.

''"Mmm, how exquisite. I can't wait to savor and dissect this sensation."''

