{{TrekkerSkill
| name = Puffloon Spits
| brief = Summons {{word|Bubble|}} the Puffloon to attack the target, with a chance to create a Wind Burst. Inflicts {{word|Ventus Mark: Breeze|wind}}. When {{word|Bubble|}} is on the battlefield, increases the squad's ATK.<br>Upgrade materials: {{Item|Wrath Beauty}} {{Item|Chess Piece of Skill}} {{Item|Shooter Game Cartridge}} {{Item|Barrage Game Cartridge}} {{Item|Demon Bee Game Cartridge}}
| cooldown = 15.0
| desc_1 = Summons {{word|Bubble|}} the Puffloon who spits wind bullets, dealing {{color|#ec6d21|7.6%}} of ATK as Ventus Minion DMG. When {{word|Bubble|}} deals DMG, there is a 25% chance to create a Wind Burst, dealing {{color|#ec6d21|13.7%}} of ATK as Ventus Minion DMG, and inflicting {{word|Ventus Mark: Breeze|wind}}. This effect can only be triggered once per second. When {{word|Bubble|}} is on the field, increases the squad's ATK by {{color|#fb8037|12%}}.<br>Upgrade materials: {{Item|Shooter Game Cartridge|quantity=6}} {{Item|Chess Piece of Skill|quantity=2}} {{Item|Dorra|quantity=13300}}
